BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>Debris</h1>
Parts broken off Delta-gliders (VESSEL::BreakPart): on the runway, a wing
tip falls to the ground and comes to rest there; in orbit, a part pushed
off at 2 m/s leaves with momentum conserved and without colliding with
the vessel it came from.
END_HYPERDESC

